# shared/feature-__name__

## Owns
- `src/commonMain/kotlin/dev/alllexey/itmowidgets/feature/__name__/`, by package:
  - `domain/`: the ports and models the screen and the app read;
  - `data/`: common implementations, bound in `__name__Module` once they replace the app's;
  - `presentation/`: `__Name__ViewModel` and its state and events in `__Name__UiState.kt`;
  - `ui/`: the stateless screen, its route, previews and test tags;
  - `di/`: `__name__Module`, the definitions Koin constructs.
- `src/commonMain/composeResources/values/strings___name__.xml`: the module's strings.
- `src/commonTest/`: ViewModel and screen host tests.
- `src/androidHostTest/`: the Koin graph test and the preview screenshot test; goldens go to `screenshots`.

## Depends on
- `:shared:core` and `:shared:designsystem`; `:shared:testing` in tests only.
- Koin and the multiplatform lifecycle; a new library comes through the version catalog with L04's review.

## Verify
`scripts/verify.sh quick`, then `scripts/verify.sh shots feature-__name__` and
`scripts/verify.sh klibs feature-__name__`.

## Hot files
- `build.gradle.kts`: the feature lane writes it, L04 reviews.
- `strings___name__.xml`: the feature lane; keys are never renamed.

